# Files that must never be published.
#
# Vercel does not serve .git or dotfiles by default, so this is belt and braces
# rather than the load-bearing guard .assetsignore is on Cloudflare — there the
# whole repo root is uploaded and the history could be reconstructed from .git
# with a tool like git-dumper. Keep both while both platforms are in play.
.git
.gitignore
.assetsignore
.vercelignore
.env
.env.*
README.md
_headers
